      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aVacuum Furnace / Dehydrator§r\n\nHarness the power of vacuum technology for industrial drying!!!\nThis machine consists of vacuum pump, main structure, drying tower three parts.\nparallel = coil * piece * 32\nEvery additional voltage step reduces the time to 80% of the original and The processing speed increases by 50% for each step of the coil\nSwitch modes using a screwdriver\nEvery additional voltage step reduces the time to 80% of the original\nWould anyone really need this machine to handle space ice cream?\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Input Bus, Input Hatch, Output Bus, Output Hatch, Energy Hatch\n[note]Structure[/note]: Heating Coils (the coil tier matters); Tiered glass (limits the energy hatch tier); the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Assembler, ZPM\n - 16x Controller Vacuum Furnace\n - 16x GT Dehydrator ZPM\n - 16x Robot Arm ZPM\n - 16x Conveyor Module ZPM\n - 32x ZPM Circuit\n - 16x Superconductor ZPM 4x Wire\n - 16x Neutronium Dense Plate\n - 4,608 L Molten Iridium",
